     "text": "Let me check the docs. To accept an upload, declare a parameter with the type UploadFile and wrap it in File, imported from fastapi. The client then sends the file as form data. Inside your function you can read its filename, content type, and contents. You'll also need to install the python-multipart package first. The details are on the Request Files page of the tutorial.",
