     "text": "Let me check the docs. Yes. You declare a list type, such as a list of UploadFile, and FastAPI gives you all the uploaded files as a list. The client sends each file under the same form field name. The Request Files page has a full example with a list of UploadFile objects. You can also mix files and regular form fields in one request, as described on the Request Forms and Files page.",
